        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;div style='font-size:9.6px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5A2B;margin-bottom:2px;'&gt;Preconditions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:8.9px;line-height:12.2px;color:#333333;'&gt;The officer is signed in. The case is unassigned or already assigned to this officer. Queue and detail reads are omitted; the two writes are shown end to end.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B7791F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40.0" y="862.0" width="508.7" height="84.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note2" value="&lt;div style='font-size:9.6px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5A2B;margin-bottom:2px;'&gt;Assignment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:8.9px;line-height:12.2px;color:#333333;'&gt;assign accepts loan_officer only, rejects another officer's case with 409 and sets assigned_officer_id + status=assigned. Re-assigning to self is allowed.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B7791F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="572.7" y="862.0" width="508.7" height="84.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note3" value="&lt;div style='font-size:9.6px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5A2B;margin-bottom:2px;'&gt;Decision&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:8.9px;line-height:12.2px;color:#333333;'&gt;decide rejects unless assigned_officer_id equals the session user (403). Allowed values are approved, declined and more_info; the last two require a note.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B7791F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1105.3" y="862.0" width="508.7" height="84.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#1F3864;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2E0;padding-bottom:3px;margin-bottom:5px;'&gt;Notation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:9.3px;line-height:14px;color:#333333;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Solid arrow, filled head&lt;/b&gt; — synchronous call, numbered in execution order&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dashed arrow, open head&lt;/b&gt; — return value or response (not a new request)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Narrow bar&lt;/b&gt; — activation: the participant is executing that call&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Participant box&lt;/b&gt; — class or module taking part; the dashed line is its lifeline&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Numbered label&lt;/b&gt; — the position of the message in the overall sequence&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;/b&gt; — constraint, guard or failure path&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A94A6;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40.0" y="970.0" width="700.0" height="150.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scope" value="&lt;div style='font-size:9.6px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5A2B;margin-bottom:2px;'&gt;Scope &amp;amp; conventions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:8.9px;line-height:12.2px;color:#333333;'&gt;Status assigned is a workflow state, not a decision value. Rejected writes leave the record unchanged. db.py does not re-check ownership; the API guard and the pre-write lookup do. Every successful write appends to application_decisions and audit_log.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B7791F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="760.0" y="970.0" width="854.0" height="150.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
